の１か月分の業績を反映しており、当該期間の同社の営業損益は黒字を見込んでおります。一方、株式会社あいプロについては、2026年10月31日をみなし取得日としているため、当期は貸借対照表のみを連結し、損益計算書には同社の業績を反映しておりません。 　また、両社の株式取得に伴う取得関連費用約47百万円については、個別業績予想においては子会社株式の取得原価に含める一方、連結業績予想においては販売費及び一般管理費として計上する見込みです。こうした連結対象期間及び会計処理の影響により、当期の連結業績予想における各段階損益は、個別業績予想を下回る見通しです。", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 8700000000, "8,700", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -85000000, "85", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -119000000, "119", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -134000000, "134", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -18.17, "18.17", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 8400000000, "8,400", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -52000000, "52", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -105000000, "105", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncome", "NetIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -107000000, "107", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -15.67, "15.67", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 8600000000, "8,600", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_